" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"276.7\" y=\"157\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">0</text><line x1=\"313.3\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"313.3\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"313.3\" y=\"157\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">1</text><line x1=\"350.0\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"350.0\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"350.0\" y=\"157\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">3</text><line x1=\"386.7\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"386.7\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"386.7\" y=\"157\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">5</text><line x1=\"423.3\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"423.3\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"423.3\" y=\"157\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">6</text><line x1=\"203.3\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"386.7\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"203.3\" cy=\"136\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"386.7\" cy=\"136\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/></svg><figcaption>Kartlardaki sayılar doğru üzerinde; yeşil bölgeye düşenler seçilir.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Bir sayının iki koşulu birden sağlaması = iki çözüm aralığının <b>kesişimi</b>.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> I’de yönü değiştirmezsen x &lt; −2 bulup yalnız −4’ü seçersin. II’de sağ tarafı 2 ile çarpmayı unutursan x ≤ 3 bulursun ve toplam 3 çıkar.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>C</b></div></div>"
