   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b><ul><li>Süreler: Bora 61,2 – Deniz 63,4 – Ayaz 64,8 – Can 66,5 (Efe: t).</li><li>Efe ikinci; eşit derece yok.</li><li>Efe, Deniz’den en az 0,5 sn kısa.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>t’nin sayı doğrusu.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Sıralamayı yorumla</b>Yüzmede kısa süre daha iyidir. İkinci olan Efe, birinci Bora’dan yavaş, Deniz’den hızlı olmalı. Eşit derece olmadığından 61,2 dâhil değil.<span class=\"sv-m\">61,2 &lt; t &lt; 63,4</span></li><li><b>0,5 saniye şartı</b>Deniz’in süresinden farkı en az 0,5 sn → ≥.<span class=\"sv-m\">63,4 − t ≥ 0,5 → −t ≥ −62,9 → t ≤ 62,9</span></li><li><b>Ortak çözüm</b>İki şart birlikte: solda boş, sağda dolu daire.<span class=\"sv-m\">61,2 &lt; t ≤ 62,9 → IV</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 172\" width=\"460\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><text x=\"8\" y=\"37\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0e7490\">Sıralama</text><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"32\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M138,27 L130,32 L138,37\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M432,27 L440,32 L432,37\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"207.5\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"207.5\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"207.5\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">61,2</text><line x1=\"285.0\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"285.0\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"285.0\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">62,9</text><line x1=\"362.5\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"362.5\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"362.5\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">63,4</text><line x1=\"207.5\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"362.5\" y2=\"32\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"207.5\" cy=\"32\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"362.5\" cy=\"32\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"8\" y=\"89\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#7c3aed\">0,5 sn şartı</text><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"84\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M138,79 L130,84 L138,89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M432,79 L440,84 L432,89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"207.5\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"207.5\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"207.5\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">61,2</text><line x1=\"285.0\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"285.0\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"285.0\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">62,9</text><line x1=\"362.5\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"362.5\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"362.5\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">63,4</text><line x1=\"134.0\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"285.0\" y2=\"84\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"285.0\" cy=\"84\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"8\" y=\"141\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#16a34a\">Ortak</text><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M138,131 L130,136 L138,141\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M432,131 L440,136 L432,141\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"207.5\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"207.5\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"207.5\" y=\"157\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">61,2</text><line x1=\"285.0\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"285.0\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"285.0\" y=\"157\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">62,9</text><line x1=\"362.5\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"362.5\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"362.5\" y=\"157\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">63,4</text><line x1=\"207.5\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"285.0\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"207.5\" cy=\"136\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"285.0\" cy=\"136\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/></svg><figcaption>Sıralama aralığı ile 0,5 saniye şartının ortak kısmı.</figcaption></figure><table class=\"sv-c\"><tr><td>I</td><td>0,5 sn şartı unutulmuş</td></tr><tr><td>II</td><td>61,2 dâhil edilmiş (eşit derece olmaz)</td></tr><tr><td>III</td><td>62,9 dâhil edilmemiş (“en az” eşitliği kapsar)</td></tr><tr class=\"ok\"><td>IV</td><td>61,2 boş, 62,9 dolu → doğru</td></tr></table><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Fark “en az” bir değerse o farkın kendisi de olur → dolu daire.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>D</b></div></div>"
