    "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 52\" width=\"240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sayı doğrusu: 12 içi boş, 43 içi dolu daire, arası boyalı\"><line x1=\"14\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"226\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><polygon points=\"4,18 16,12 16,24\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><polygon points=\"236,18 224,12 224,24\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"18\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"18\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"18\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#2563eb\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">12</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">43</text></svg><br>12 &lt; x ≤ 43",
