   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b><ul><li>Makine: x → 2 ile çarp → sonucu 1’den çıkar.</li><li>Çıktı: −7 ≤ çıktı &lt; 5.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>x’in sayı doğrusu.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Çıktıyı x ile yaz</b>Önce 2x, sonra 1 − 2x.<span class=\"sv-m\">çıktı = 1 − 2x</span></li><li><b>Aralığı kur</b>−7’ye eşit olabilir, 5’e eşit olamaz.<span class=\"sv-m\">−7 ≤ 1 − 2x &lt; 5</span></li><li><b>1’i çıkar</b><span class=\"sv-m\">−8 ≤ −2x &lt; 4</span></li><li><b>−2’ye böl, yönleri çevir</b>İşaretler döner; küçükten büyüğe yeniden yazarız.<span class=\"sv-m\">4 ≥ x &gt; −2 → −2 &lt; x ≤ 4</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 470 120\" width=\"470\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><text x=\"8\" y=\"37\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#7c3aed\">Çıktı</text><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"32\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M98,27 L90,32 L98,37\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M442,27 L450,32 L442,37\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"135.0\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"135.0\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"135.0\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−7</text><line x1=\"180.0\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"180.0\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−4</text><line x1=\"225.0\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"225.0\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"225.0\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−2</text><line x1=\"270.0\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"270.0\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"270.0\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">0</text><line x1=\"315.0\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"315.0\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"315.0\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2</text><line x1=\"360.0\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"360.0\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"360.0\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">4</text><line x1=\"405.0\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"405.0\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"405.0\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">5</text><line x1=\"135.0\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"405.0\" y2=\"32\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"135.0\" cy=\"32\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"405.0\" cy=\"32\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"8\" y=\"89\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#16a34a\">x</text><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"450\" y2=\"84\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M98,79 L90,84 L98,89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M442,79 L450,84 L442,89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"135.0\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"135.0\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"135.0\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−7</text><line x1=\"180.0\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"180.0\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−4</text><line x1=\"225.0\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"225.0\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"225.0\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−2</text><line x1=\"270.0\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"270.0\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"270.0\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">0</text><line x1=\"315.0\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"315.0\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"315.0\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2</text><line x1=\"360.0\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"360.0\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"360.0\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">4</text><line x1=\"405.0\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"405.0\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"405.0\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">5</text><line x1=\"225.0\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"360.0\" y2=\"84\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"225.0\" cy=\"84\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"360.0\" cy=\"84\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/></svg><figcaption>Çıktının dolu ucu (−7) x’te 4’e, boş ucu (5) x’te −2’ye karşılık gelir.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Negatif katsayı varsa uçlar yer değiştirir; dolu/boş bilgisi de uçla birlikte taşınır.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Yönü çevirmeyi unutursan −2 ≤ x &lt; 4 (C); makineyi 1 + 2x sanırsan −4 ≤ x &lt; 2 (D) bulursun.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>A</b></div></div>"
