   "a": "C",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b><ul><li>A: 0. km, B: 90. km, geçit: 52. km; sağlık ocağı x. km (A ile geçit arasında).</li><li>A’ya uzaklık ≤ 2 · (B’ye uzaklık); B’ye uzaklık ≤ 2 · (A’ya uzaklık).</li><li>Geçide en az 8 km.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>x için sayı doğrusu.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Uzaklıkları yaz</b><span class=\"sv-m\">A’ya: x     B’ye: 90 − x     geçide: 52 − x</span></li><li><b>I. koşul</b><span class=\"sv-m\">x ≤ 2(90 − x) → 3x ≤ 180 → x ≤ 60</span></li><li><b>II. koşul</b><span class=\"sv-m\">90 − x ≤ 2x → 90 ≤ 3x → x ≥ 30</span></li><li><b>III. koşul</b><span class=\"sv-m\">52 − x ≥ 8 → x ≤ 44</span></li><li><b>Birleştir</b><span class=\"sv-m\">30 ≤ x ≤ 44</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 480 172\" width=\"480\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><text x=\"8\" y=\"37\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0e7490\">I ve II</text><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"32\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M118,27 L110,32 L118,37\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M452,27 L460,32 L452,37\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"160.0\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"160.0\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"160.0\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">0</text><line x1=\"210.0\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"210.0\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"210.0\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">30</text><line x1=\"260.0\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"260.0\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"260.0\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">44</text><line x1=\"310.0\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"310.0\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"310.0\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">52</text><line x1=\"360.0\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"360.0\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"360.0\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">60</text><line x1=\"410.0\" y1=\"28\" x2=\"410.0\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"410.0\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">90</text><line x1=\"210.0\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"360.0\" y2=\"32\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"210.0\" cy=\"32\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#0e7490\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"360.0\" cy=\"32\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#0e7490\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"8\" y=\"89\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#7c3aed\">Geçit</text><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"84\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M118,79 L110,84 L118,89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M452,79 L460,84 L452,89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"160.0\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"160.0\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"160.0\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">0</text><line x1=\"210.0\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"210.0\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"210.0\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">30</text><line x1=\"260.0\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"260.0\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"260.0\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">44</text><line x1=\"310.0\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"310.0\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"310.0\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">52</text><line x1=\"360.0\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"360.0\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"360.0\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">60</text><line x1=\"410.0\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"410.0\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"410.0\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">90</text><line x1=\"114.0\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"260.0\" y2=\"84\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"260.0\" cy=\"84\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"8\" y=\"141\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#16a34a\">Ortak</text><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M118,131 L110,136 L118,141\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M452,131 L460,136 L452,141\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"160.0\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"160.0\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"160.0\" y=\"157\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">0</text><line x1=\"210.0\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"210.0\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"210.0\" y=\"157\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">30</text><line x1=\"260.0\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"260.0\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"260.0\" y=\"157\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">44</text><line x1=\"310.0\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"310.0\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"310.0\" y=\"157\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">52</text><line x1=\"360.0\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"360.0\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"360.0\" y=\"157\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">60</text><line x1=\"410.0\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"410.0\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"410.0\" y=\"157\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">90</text><line x1=\"210.0\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"260.0\" y2=\"136\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"210.0\" cy=\"136\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"260.0\" cy=\"136\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#16a34a\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/></svg><figcaption>Üç koşulun ortak kısmı 30 ile 44 arası (uçlar dâhil).</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> “Fazla olmamalı” ≤ demektir; sınır dâhildir.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Geçit koşulunu unutursan 30 ≤ x ≤ 60 (A); sağlık ocağını geçidin öbür tarafına koyarsan B’yi bulursun.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>C</b></div></div>"
